# SYNTHESISED to exercise the "(none)" facet value: a provider-level RPC
# carries no tf_resource_type at all, because it belongs to the provider
# rather than to any one resource -- GetProviderSchema, ConfigureProvider
# and ValidateProviderConfig are all of this shape. Its span's ResourceType
# is therefore empty, and the facet pane offers it as "(none)". Every other
# RPC fixture in this repo gives every span a resource type, which is why no
# test could tell a facet value the pane OFFERS from one the filter can
# MATCH. Modelled on testdata/provider-rpc.log's "Received downstream
# response" shape; values are invented and no line here is from a real run.
